WEBVTT

00:02.509 --> 00:03.843
KATARA: Water...

00:04.677 --> 00:06.429
Earth...

00:06.638 --> 00:08.181
Fire...

00:08.681 --> 00:10.266
Air.

00:11.059 --> 00:14.562
Long ago, the four nations lived
together in harmony.

00:15.063 --> 00:19.484
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.567 --> 00:23.154
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

00:23.238 --> 00:27.367
But when the world needed him most,
he vanished.

00:27.450 --> 00:30.662
100 years passed and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar.

00:30.745 --> 00:32.747
An airbender named Aang.

00:32.830 --> 00:35.208
And although his airbending
skills are great,

00:35.291 --> 00:37.669
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.752 --> 00:38.795
AANG: Oof!

00:38.878 --> 00:42.340
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:42.882 --> 00:44.634
( ♪ )

00:48.054 --> 00:50.390
( MAN READING )

00:50.723 --> 00:52.475
AANG: So what's the new plan?

00:52.559 --> 00:55.061
SOKKA: The new plan is the old plan.

00:55.144 --> 00:56.896
You just need to master all four elements

00:56.980 --> 00:59.274
and confront the Fire Lord
before the comet comes.

00:59.357 --> 01:01.693
Where am I supposed to get
a firebending teacher?

01:01.985 --> 01:03.152
Hello.

01:03.236 --> 01:04.571
Zuko here.

01:04.654 --> 01:08.575
I think it's time I joined your group
and taught the Avatar firebending.

01:08.992 --> 01:13.037
And I know my destiny is to help you
restore balance to the world.

01:13.538 --> 01:16.499
I think you are supposed to be
my firebending teacher.

01:18.001 --> 01:22.755
( MEN VOCALIZING RHYTHMICALLY )

01:24.757 --> 01:28.386
ZUKO: I know you're nervous,
but remember, firebending

01:28.469 --> 01:31.097
in and of itself is not something to fear.

01:31.431 --> 01:32.974
( SIGHING )

01:33.057 --> 01:34.058
Okay.

01:34.142 --> 01:35.351
Not something to fear.

01:35.435 --> 01:37.270
But if you don't respect it

01:37.353 --> 01:40.106
it'll chew you up and spit you out
like an angry komodo rhino.

01:40.189 --> 01:41.524
( GASPING )

01:41.608 --> 01:43.067
Now, show me what you've got.

01:43.151 --> 01:45.361
Any amount of fire you can make.

01:45.445 --> 01:47.655
( BREATHING HEAVILY )

01:52.327 --> 01:54.537
Maybe I need a little more instruction.

01:54.621 --> 01:56.748
Perhaps a demonstration?

01:56.831 --> 01:58.374
ZUKO: Good idea

01:58.458 --> 02:00.126
You might want to take
a couple steps back.

02:00.710 --> 02:02.003
( INHALES )

02:03.046 --> 02:04.839
( GRUNTING )

02:06.924 --> 02:08.343
What was that?

02:08.426 --> 02:10.261
That was the worst
firebending I've ever seen.

02:11.095 --> 02:13.139
I thought it was nice.

02:13.556 --> 02:16.601
( GRUNTING )

02:16.684 --> 02:18.186
( GROANING )

02:18.269 --> 02:20.063
Why is this happening?

02:20.146 --> 02:22.231
Maybe it's the altitude.

02:22.398 --> 02:24.692
Yeah, could be.

02:28.780 --> 02:31.115
( GRUNTING )

02:33.159 --> 02:34.202
( YAWNING )

02:34.285 --> 02:37.121
Just breathe, and...

02:37.955 --> 02:40.083
That one kind of felt hot.

02:40.208 --> 02:41.626
Don't patronize me.

02:41.709 --> 02:42.960
You know what it's supposed to look like.

02:43.044 --> 02:44.462
Sorry, Sifu hotman.

02:44.545 --> 02:46.297
And stop calling me that.

02:49.759 --> 02:51.010
SOKKA: Hey, jerks.

02:51.094 --> 02:54.389
Mind if I watch you two jerks
do your jerk bending?

02:54.972 --> 02:56.683
Get out of here.

02:56.766 --> 02:58.226
Okay, take it easy.

02:58.309 --> 02:59.477
I was just kidding around.

02:59.560 --> 03:00.853
( CHUCKLING )

03:00.937 --> 03:02.313
Jerk bending.

03:02.397 --> 03:03.773
Still got it.

03:03.856 --> 03:04.941
( GROANING )

03:15.368 --> 03:16.786
ZUKO: Listen, everybody.

03:16.869 --> 03:18.913
I've got some pretty bad news.

03:18.996 --> 03:20.498
I've lost my stuff.

03:20.623 --> 03:21.833
Don't look at me.

03:21.916 --> 03:23.710
I didn't touch your stuff.

03:24.293 --> 03:26.129
I'm talking about my firebending.

03:26.629 --> 03:28.047
It's gone.

03:28.131 --> 03:30.758
( KATARA LAUGHING )

03:31.384 --> 03:32.593
I'm sorry.

03:32.677 --> 03:34.178
I'm just laughing at the irony.

03:34.262 --> 03:36.013
You know, how it would've been nice for us

03:36.097 --> 03:38.182
if you'd lost your firebending
a long time ago?

03:38.307 --> 03:39.767
Well, it's not lost.

03:39.851 --> 03:42.395
It's just weaker for some reason.

03:42.478 --> 03:44.689
Maybe you're just not as good
as you think you are.

03:45.606 --> 03:47.024
Ouch.

03:49.193 --> 03:51.446
I bet it's because I changed sides.

03:51.612 --> 03:53.114
That's ridiculous.

03:53.322 --> 03:54.574
I don't know.

03:54.824 --> 03:56.534
Maybe it isn't.

03:56.617 --> 03:58.661
Maybe your firebending comes from rage

03:58.745 --> 04:02.081
and you just don't have enough anger
to fuel it the way you used to.

04:02.165 --> 04:05.626
So all we need to do is make Zuko angry.

04:05.710 --> 04:07.003
Easy enough.

04:07.086 --> 04:09.297
( LAUGHING )

04:10.339 --> 04:11.632
Okay, cut it out!

04:11.716 --> 04:12.759
Look.

04:12.842 --> 04:16.471
Even if you're right, I don't want to rely
on hate and anger anymore.

04:16.763 --> 04:18.264
There has to be another way.

04:18.347 --> 04:21.809
You're gonna need to learn to draw
your firebending from a different source.

04:21.893 --> 04:24.437
I recommend the original source.

04:24.520 --> 04:26.272
How's he supposed to do that?

04:26.355 --> 04:27.774
By jumping into a volcano?

04:27.857 --> 04:29.358
No.

04:29.442 --> 04:33.321
Zuko needs to go back to whatever
the source of firebending is.

04:33.404 --> 04:35.782
So is it jumping into a volcano?

04:35.865 --> 04:37.200
I don't know.

04:37.283 --> 04:39.994
For earthbending, the original benders
were badgermoles.

04:40.077 --> 04:44.290
One day, when I was little,
I ran away and hid in a cave.

04:44.373 --> 04:45.792
( CRYING )

04:45.875 --> 04:48.044
( CRASHING )

04:48.294 --> 04:49.754
That's where I met them.

04:49.837 --> 04:51.422
( GROWLING )

04:53.883 --> 04:57.678
( LAUGHING )

05:00.223 --> 05:04.227
They were blind, just like me, so we
understood each other.

05:04.310 --> 05:08.439
I was able to learn earthbending,
not just as a martial art

05:08.523 --> 05:10.900
but as an extension of my senses.

05:11.192 --> 05:15.822
For them, the original earthbenders,
it wasn't just about fighting.

05:16.239 --> 05:19.534
It was their way of interacting
with the world.

05:21.118 --> 05:22.870
AANG: That's amazing, Toph.

05:23.162 --> 05:26.749
I learned from the monks, but the
original airbenders were the sky bison.

05:27.166 --> 05:29.836
Maybe you can give me
a lesson sometime, buddy.

05:29.919 --> 05:31.128
( GROWLING )

05:31.212 --> 05:33.172
Well, this doesn't help me.

05:33.256 --> 05:36.676
The original firebenders
were the dragons and they're extinct.

05:36.759 --> 05:38.094
What do you mean?

05:38.177 --> 05:41.639
Roku had a dragon, and there were
plenty of dragons when I was a kid.

05:41.722 --> 05:43.599
Well, they aren't around anymore, okay?

05:43.683 --> 05:44.767
Okay, okay.

05:44.851 --> 05:46.269
Sorry.

05:46.352 --> 05:48.145
ZUKO: But maybe there's another way.

05:48.229 --> 05:51.774
The first people to learn from the dragons
were the ancient Sun Warriors.

05:52.358 --> 05:54.777
AANG: Sun warriors?

05:54.861 --> 05:57.113
Well, I know they weren't around
when I was a kid.

05:57.196 --> 06:00.074
No, they died off
thousands of years ago.

06:00.658 --> 06:04.412
But their civilization wasn't too far
from where we are now.

06:04.495 --> 06:07.039
Maybe we can learn
by poking around the ruins.

06:07.123 --> 06:09.000
It's like the monks used to tell me.

06:09.458 --> 06:12.503
Sometimes, the shadows of the past
can be felt by the present.

06:12.587 --> 06:14.213
SOKKA: So what?

06:14.297 --> 06:17.174
Maybe you'll pick up some
super old Sun Warrior energy

06:17.258 --> 06:19.468
just by standing where they stood
1,000 years ago?

06:19.552 --> 06:21.012
ZUKO: More or less.

06:21.095 --> 06:25.641
Either I find a new way to firebend,
or the Avatar has to find a new teacher.

06:31.814 --> 06:35.067
( WHOOSHING )

06:35.484 --> 06:37.153
We've been riding for hours.

06:37.236 --> 06:39.906
I don't know why, but I thought
this thing would be a lot faster.

06:40.406 --> 06:41.782
( GROWLING )

06:41.866 --> 06:43.451
Appa's right, Zuko.

06:43.534 --> 06:46.454
In our group, typically we start out our
missions with a more upbeat attitude.

06:46.913 --> 06:48.581
( GROANING ), I can't believe this.

06:48.789 --> 06:49.874
AANG: Don't worry.

06:49.957 --> 06:51.000
You'll get the hang of it.

06:58.799 --> 07:00.092
Whoa!

07:04.263 --> 07:05.848
ZUKO: Even though
these buildings are ancient

07:05.932 --> 07:08.267
there's something eerily
familiar about them.

07:08.643 --> 07:11.854
I can tell the fire sages' temples are
somehow descended from these.

07:12.063 --> 07:14.815
AANG: Okay, we've learned something
about architecture.

07:15.149 --> 07:17.693
Hopefully, we'll learn something about
firebending too.

07:17.818 --> 07:19.278
The past can be a great teacher.

07:19.362 --> 07:20.738
( SCREAMING )

07:23.032 --> 07:24.367
( AANG GRUNTING )

07:24.492 --> 07:26.202
( WHIMPERING )

07:26.285 --> 07:29.497
Zuko, I think the past
is trying to kill me.

07:29.580 --> 07:30.915
I can't believe it.

07:30.998 --> 07:33.834
This booby trap must be centuries old,
and it still works.

07:34.293 --> 07:35.878
There's probably a lot more.

07:35.962 --> 07:37.880
Maybe this means we shouldn't be here.

07:42.635 --> 07:44.720
Where's that upbeat attitude
you were talking about?

07:45.513 --> 07:49.684
Besides, people don't make traps unless
they've got something worth protecting.

07:52.269 --> 07:53.312
Look.

07:53.396 --> 07:54.814
This seems promising.

07:54.897 --> 07:58.901
Though I'm not sure this tells us
about the original source of firebending.

07:59.694 --> 08:01.278
They look pretty angry to me.

08:01.362 --> 08:03.864
AANG: I thought the dragons were
friends with the Sun Warriors.

08:03.948 --> 08:05.825
ZUKO: Well, they had
a funny way of showing it.

08:10.162 --> 08:13.791
Zuko, something happened
to the dragons in the last 100 years.

08:14.542 --> 08:15.918
Something you're not telling me.

08:16.252 --> 08:18.838
My great-grandfather Sozin happened.

08:19.714 --> 08:22.466
He started the tradition
of hunting dragons for glory.

08:22.550 --> 08:24.260
They were the ultimate firebenders.

08:24.385 --> 08:28.055
And if you could conquer one, your
firebending talents would become legendary

08:28.139 --> 08:30.516
and you'd earn the honorary title, dragon.

08:31.475 --> 08:37.106
The last great dragon was conquered
long before I was born, by my uncle.

08:37.982 --> 08:42.528
But I thought your uncle was,
I don't know, good?

08:42.820 --> 08:44.697
He had a complicated past.

08:45.573 --> 08:47.158
Family tradition, I guess.

08:48.784 --> 08:49.869
Let's just move on.

08:58.919 --> 09:01.213
( GRUNTING )

09:01.297 --> 09:02.381
It's locked up.

09:04.967 --> 09:06.177
Wait.

09:07.136 --> 09:09.805
It's a celestial calendar.

09:09.889 --> 09:13.184
Just like the fire sages
have in their temples.

09:13.267 --> 09:15.061
I bet that sun stone opens the door

09:15.144 --> 09:18.731
but only when sunlight hits it
at just the right angle on the solstice.

09:18.814 --> 09:20.149
Monkey feathers.

09:20.483 --> 09:21.817
The solstice again.

09:21.901 --> 09:23.444
We can't wait here that long.

09:23.611 --> 09:25.154
No, we can't.

09:25.237 --> 09:27.114
But we might be able to speed time up.

09:27.740 --> 09:29.992
Let's see if we can outsmart
the sun stone.

09:34.663 --> 09:36.040
Nothing's happening.

09:36.123 --> 09:37.291
Come on.

09:38.876 --> 09:40.669
( RUMBLING )

09:42.421 --> 09:45.549
You know, Zuko, I don't care what everyone
else says about you.

09:45.841 --> 09:47.009
You're pretty smart.

09:52.973 --> 09:53.974
( GASPING )

09:54.058 --> 09:55.142
Relax.

09:55.226 --> 09:56.685
They're just statues.

10:04.068 --> 10:07.238
It says this is something
called the Dancing Dragon.

10:18.791 --> 10:20.376
Zuko, get over here.

10:20.459 --> 10:21.710
I want you to dance with me.

10:21.794 --> 10:23.754
- What?
- Just do it.

10:25.005 --> 10:26.257
( ZUKO GROANING )

10:26.340 --> 10:28.092
Let's follow the steps of the statues.

10:32.596 --> 10:33.931
Don't you see?

10:34.014 --> 10:35.349
These aren't dance moves.

10:35.432 --> 10:37.184
These statues are giving us a lesson.

10:37.518 --> 10:41.564
I think this is some kind
of Sun Warrior firebending form.

10:41.647 --> 10:43.941
This better teach us some
really good firebending.

10:51.991 --> 10:53.534
Hooray!

10:53.617 --> 10:54.785
Wait.

10:54.869 --> 10:57.121
What exactly is that?

10:57.204 --> 10:58.956
It's some kind of mystical gemstone.

10:59.039 --> 11:00.374
Well, don't touch it.

11:00.457 --> 11:01.584
Why not?

11:01.667 --> 11:03.794
Remember what happened out there
with those spikes?

11:03.878 --> 11:08.048
I'm just very suspicious of giant,
glowing gems sitting on pedestals.

11:09.216 --> 11:12.136
It feels almost alive.

11:13.220 --> 11:15.556
( SCREAMING )

11:16.098 --> 11:18.058
Oh, no, it's another trap.

11:20.603 --> 11:21.687
( GROANING )

11:21.770 --> 11:23.063
I can't pull free.

11:23.147 --> 11:24.815
It's like some kind of glue.

11:30.487 --> 11:32.364
( GRUNTING )

11:32.573 --> 11:33.699
( GRUNTING )

11:38.329 --> 11:39.872
( GROANING )

11:42.833 --> 11:44.835
I can't move.

11:44.919 --> 11:46.212
Zuko, do something.

11:46.295 --> 11:47.630
Me?

11:47.713 --> 11:49.089
I can't move either.

11:51.634 --> 11:53.802
( GROANING )

11:54.720 --> 11:56.347
It stopped.

11:56.430 --> 11:58.098
At least we have air.

11:58.182 --> 12:01.060
Maybe if we stay calm,
we can figure a way out of this.

12:07.066 --> 12:11.028
You had to pick up
the glowing egg, didn't you?

12:11.528 --> 12:13.364
At least I made
something happen.

12:13.447 --> 12:15.908
If it were up to you, we'd never
have made it past the courtyard.

12:15.991 --> 12:17.576
Help!

12:18.244 --> 12:20.162
Who are you yelling to?

12:20.246 --> 12:21.830
Nobody's lived here for centuries.

12:21.914 --> 12:24.708
Well, what do you think we should do?

12:25.584 --> 12:27.753
Think about our place in the universe?

12:29.672 --> 12:31.257
( SIGHING )

12:33.509 --> 12:34.677
Who is down there?

12:48.190 --> 12:52.361
For trying to take our sun stone,
you must be severely punished.

12:52.444 --> 12:54.697
We didn't come here
to take your sun stone.

12:54.780 --> 12:57.700
We came here to find the
ancient origin of all firebending.

12:58.325 --> 12:59.910
MAN: yeah, right.

12:59.994 --> 13:03.414
They are obviously thieves,
here to steal Sun Warrior treasures.

13:03.497 --> 13:04.873
AANG: Please.

13:04.957 --> 13:08.794
I don't normally play this card,
but I'm the Avatar.

13:13.507 --> 13:15.050
Just hear us out.

13:15.134 --> 13:19.388
My name is Zuko,
Crown Prince of the Fire Nation.

13:19.471 --> 13:21.056
Or at least, I used to be.

13:21.140 --> 13:23.976
I know my people have distorted
the ways of firebending,

13:24.059 --> 13:26.103
to be fueled
by anger and rage.

13:26.186 --> 13:29.940
But now I want to learn the true way,
the original way.

13:30.482 --> 13:31.817
When we came here, I never imagined

13:31.900 --> 13:35.029
the Sun Warrior civilization
was secretly alive.

13:35.112 --> 13:37.614
I am truly humbled to be in your presence.

13:38.324 --> 13:40.242
Please, teach us.

13:41.410 --> 13:44.246
If you wish to learn the ways of the sun

13:44.330 --> 13:48.042
you must learn them from
the masters Ran and Shao.

13:48.500 --> 13:50.044
Ran and Shao?

13:50.127 --> 13:51.337
There are two of them?

13:51.420 --> 13:55.466
When you present yourselves
to them, they will examine you.

13:55.549 --> 14:00.012
They'll read your hearts,
your souls, and your ancestry.

14:00.095 --> 14:02.473
If they deem you worthy,
they'll teach you.

14:02.556 --> 14:07.353
If they don't, you'll be
destroyed on the spot.

14:17.279 --> 14:19.615
CHIEF: If you're going to see the masters,

14:19.698 --> 14:23.369
you must bring them a piece
of the eternal flame.

14:23.952 --> 14:28.040
This fire is the very first one.

14:28.123 --> 14:30.667
It was given to man by the dragons.

14:30.751 --> 14:33.837
We have kept it going
for thousands of years.

14:33.921 --> 14:35.672
I don't believe it.

14:35.881 --> 14:39.093
CHIEF: You will each take
a piece of it to the masters

14:39.176 --> 14:43.555
to show your commitment to
the sacred art of firebending.

14:44.181 --> 14:46.392
Um, Mister Sun Chief, sir?

14:46.475 --> 14:49.144
Yeah, I'm not a firebender yet.

14:49.228 --> 14:51.772
Couldn't my friend here
carry my fire for me?

14:51.855 --> 14:52.981
No.

14:57.694 --> 15:03.158
This ritual illustrates
the essence of Sun Warrior philosophy.

15:03.575 --> 15:05.953
You must maintain a constant heat.

15:06.036 --> 15:09.540
The flame will go out
if you make it too small.

15:09.623 --> 15:12.960
Make it too big,
and you might lose control.

15:16.004 --> 15:17.589
I'm sorry.

15:17.673 --> 15:19.716
I'm just a little nervous.

15:21.385 --> 15:23.679
It's like a little heartbeat.

15:23.762 --> 15:27.933
Fire is life, not just destruction.

15:28.016 --> 15:30.811
You will take your flames up there.

15:30.894 --> 15:34.440
The cave of the masters
is beneath that rock.

15:44.032 --> 15:45.242
Hurry up.

15:45.325 --> 15:46.452
I can't.

15:46.535 --> 15:48.245
If I walk too fast, my flame'll go out.

15:48.328 --> 15:50.706
Your flame's gonna go out
because it's too small.

15:50.956 --> 15:52.166
You're too timid.

15:52.249 --> 15:53.375
Give it more juice.

15:53.459 --> 15:55.169
But what if I can't control it?

15:55.252 --> 15:56.336
You can do it.

15:56.420 --> 15:57.421
I know you can.

15:57.504 --> 15:59.006
You're a talented kid.

16:12.561 --> 16:18.775
Facing the judgment of the firebending
masters will be very dangerous for you.

16:18.859 --> 16:23.822
Your ancestors are directly responsible
for the dragons' disappearance.

16:24.490 --> 16:28.035
The masters might not be
so happy to see you.

16:28.118 --> 16:30.078
I know I wouldn't be.

16:30.162 --> 16:32.122
But once they find out I'm the Avatar...

16:32.289 --> 16:34.625
Have you forgotten that you vanished

16:34.708 --> 16:37.753
allowing the Fire Nation
to wreak havoc on the world?

16:37.836 --> 16:41.381
The decline of the dragons
is your burden too.

16:53.560 --> 16:55.604
We could turn back now.

16:55.687 --> 16:58.273
We've already learned more
about fire than we'd hoped.

16:59.525 --> 17:01.693
No, we're seeing through to the end.

17:01.777 --> 17:05.197
We're gonna meet these masters
and find out what's so great about them.

17:05.280 --> 17:08.033
What if they judge us and attack us?

17:08.116 --> 17:10.118
Well, we're the fire prince
and the Avatar.

17:10.202 --> 17:12.955
I think we could take these guys in
a fight, whoever they are.

17:19.545 --> 17:20.921
Bring 'em out.

17:21.004 --> 17:22.756
Chanters!

17:24.299 --> 17:28.554
( MEN VOCALIZING RHYTHMICALLY )

18:08.218 --> 18:13.932
MAN: Those who wish to meet the masters
Ran and Shao will now present their fire.

18:18.604 --> 18:20.772
CHIEF: Sound the call.

18:22.149 --> 18:24.484
( HORN BLOWING )

18:25.319 --> 18:27.029
( CRASHING )

18:28.780 --> 18:29.906
What's happening?

18:34.453 --> 18:35.579
( GASPING )

18:35.662 --> 18:37.039
Zuko, my fire went out.

18:37.122 --> 18:38.248
What do you want me to do?

18:38.332 --> 18:39.333
Give me some of yours.

18:39.416 --> 18:40.709
( GRUNTING )

18:40.792 --> 18:42.419
- No, just make your own.
- I can't.

18:42.502 --> 18:43.503
( GRUNTING )

18:43.587 --> 18:45.464
ZUKO: Get some from one of those warriors.
Hurry.

18:45.631 --> 18:47.090
Stop cheating off me.

18:47.341 --> 18:48.634
AANG: Quit being stingy.

18:49.009 --> 18:51.803
( BOTH GRUNTING )

18:56.183 --> 18:57.476
( CRASHING )

18:58.852 --> 19:00.062
BOTH: Uh-oh.

19:01.813 --> 19:02.939
( DRAGON GROWLING )

19:15.243 --> 19:16.662
These are the masters.

19:16.745 --> 19:18.705
You still think we can take 'em?

19:18.789 --> 19:19.915
Shh.

19:19.998 --> 19:21.166
I never said that.

19:27.589 --> 19:29.466
Oh, here it comes.

19:29.549 --> 19:30.759
Any moment now.

19:30.842 --> 19:32.260
Dinner for the masters.

19:32.344 --> 19:33.345
Quiet, Ham Ghao.

19:33.428 --> 19:34.638
What?

19:34.721 --> 19:36.056
Everyone's thinking it.

19:44.398 --> 19:48.235
Zuko, I think we're supposed to
do the dragon dance with them.

19:48.360 --> 19:49.736
What?

19:49.820 --> 19:52.614
What about this situation makes you think
they want us to dance?

19:52.698 --> 19:55.492
Well, I think they want us
to do something.

19:56.159 --> 19:58.036
Let's just try it.

19:58.120 --> 19:59.162
Fine.

20:25.188 --> 20:26.982
Judgment time.

20:27.065 --> 20:29.359
( DRAGON GROWLING )

20:31.319 --> 20:32.529
( WHIMPERING )

20:36.199 --> 20:37.826
( AANG AND ZUKO SCREAMING )

20:48.962 --> 20:50.172
( GASPING )

20:52.132 --> 20:53.592
I understand.

21:14.946 --> 21:16.823
Their fire was beautiful.

21:16.990 --> 21:20.452
I saw so many colors,
colors I've never imagined.

21:20.535 --> 21:22.287
AANG: Like firebending harmony.

21:22.370 --> 21:23.705
Yes.

21:24.414 --> 21:29.503
They judged you, and gave you visions of
the meaning of firebending.

21:30.003 --> 21:32.380
I can't believe there are
still living dragons

21:32.464 --> 21:35.550
My uncle Iroh said he faced
the last dragon and killed it.

21:35.634 --> 21:37.385
So your uncle lied.

21:37.469 --> 21:40.722
Actually, it wasn't a total lie.

21:40.806 --> 21:44.184
Iroh was the last outsider
to face the masters.

21:44.267 --> 21:49.481
They deemed him worthy
and passed the secret on to him as well.

21:50.273 --> 21:53.944
ZUKO: He must've lied to protect them,
so no one else would hunt them.

21:54.694 --> 21:58.615
All this time, I thought
firebending was destruction.

21:58.907 --> 22:02.702
Since I hurt Katara,
I've been too afraid and hesitant

22:02.911 --> 22:05.080
But now I know what it really is.

22:05.163 --> 22:07.457
It's energy, and life.

22:07.833 --> 22:08.917
Yeah.

22:09.000 --> 22:11.294
It's like the sun, but inside of you.

22:11.378 --> 22:12.963
Do you guys realize this?

22:13.046 --> 22:19.094
Well, our civilization is called
the Sun Warriors, so yeah.

22:19.177 --> 22:21.847
That's why my firebending
was so weak before,

22:21.930 --> 22:25.517
because for so many years,
hunting you was my drive.

22:25.600 --> 22:27.477
It was my purpose.

22:27.561 --> 22:31.189
So when I joined you,
I lost sight of my inner fire.

22:31.648 --> 22:34.359
But now, I have a new drive.

22:34.442 --> 22:38.405
I have to help you defeat my father
and restore balance to the world.

22:49.457 --> 22:55.046
Now that you have learned the secrets
and you know about our tribe's existence,

22:55.922 --> 23:00.719
we have no choice but to
imprison you here forever.

23:02.387 --> 23:04.556
Just kidding.

23:05.181 --> 23:07.893
But seriously, don't tell anyone.

23:10.020 --> 23:15.025
AANG: With this technique the dragons
showed us, Zuko and I will be unstoppable.

23:18.403 --> 23:19.863
( APPLAUSE )

23:19.946 --> 23:22.032
SOKKA: Yeah, that's a great
dance you two learned there.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.533
It's not a dance.

23:23.617 --> 23:24.910
It's a firebending form.

23:25.243 --> 23:28.371
We'll just tap dance our way
to victory over the Fire Lord.

23:28.455 --> 23:31.791
It's a sacred form that happens to be
thousands of years old.

23:32.292 --> 23:33.460
Oh, yeah?

23:33.543 --> 23:35.128
What's your little form called?

23:36.129 --> 23:37.881
The Dancing Dragon.

23:38.423 --> 23:40.717
( LAUGHTER )

23:49.851 --> 23:52.646
( MEN VOCALIZING RHYTHMICALLY )

23:58.652 --> 24:00.362
( ♪ )
